WEBVTT

00:11:28.783 --> 00:11:33.354
because thinking globally,
acting locally ...

00:11:34.552 --> 00:11:35.991
does not work.

00:11:36.015 --> 00:11:37.490
We've tried that in Bhutan.

00:11:38.463 --> 00:11:42.720
We've made immense sacrifices
to act locally ...

00:11:44.705 --> 00:11:49.831
and while individual localized efforts
will continue to be important,

00:11:49.855 --> 00:11:53.308
they cannot stand up
to the onslaught of climate change.

00:11:53.677 --> 00:11:57.407
To stand up to climate change,
we must work together.

00:11:58.272 --> 00:12:01.931
We must think globally and act regionally.